<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-FINNISH AIRPORTS' JULY CARGO UP 18 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-FINNISH AIRPORTS' JULY CARGO UP 18 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's domestic and international airports handled 8,051 tonnes of freight in July, an 18 percent rise on the same month a year ago, Finland's civil aviation administration said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The administration published the following figures about airport activity.</p>
<p>					  JULY		  JAN-JULY</p>
<p>				  1997    Pct change   1997  Pct change</p>
<p> Cargo (in tonnes)	  8,051	 18.0    53,036	 9.0</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)	   1,458	  7.4    10,753	 2.7</p>
<p> Landings		    24,601	 10.4   160,780	-0.5</p>
<p> Passengers (in millions) 0.952	 13.6     6.707	 9.9</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
